flowchart LR
    UI[Flutter V2] -->|JWT + original image| API[FastAPI /v2]
    API --> ASSET[Immutable source storage]
    API --> DB[(Supabase PostgreSQL + RLS)]
    API --> RQ[Redis / RQ]
    RQ --> WORKER[Analysis worker]
    BUNDLE[(TME-Nuclei V2 bundle)] --> WORKER
    ASSET --> WORKER
    WORKER --> TILE[QC + scale + overlapping tiles]
    TILE --> DENSE[7-head TorchScript inference]
    DENSE --> INST[Watershed + 132-D classifier]
    INST --> CAL[Pixel/instance fusion + calibration]
    CAL --> STITCH[Cross-tile stitching]
    STITCH --> CELLS[Global reviewable cells]
    CELLS --> DB
    CELLS --> CONTEXT[Pathologist tumor context / ROI]
    CONTEXT --> SPATIAL[Physical SpatialEngine]
    SPATIAL --> POLICY[Versioned TMEPolicy]
    POLICY --> REPORT[Deterministic report]
    REPORT --> DB
